
## 🗂️ Dataset Description

- **Source**: Online Retail II (UCI) from Kaggle  
- **Time Period**: 2017 – 2020  
- **Records**: 1,064 daily observations  
- **Target Variable**: Daily number of patient admissions  
- **Key Columns**:
  - Date of Admission (D.O.A)
  - Admissions count  

**Dataset Link:**  
